@startuml Sequence Diagram - MITM Flow
participant "Dofus Client" as Client
participant "MITM Proxy" as Proxy
participant "Rust Parser" as Parser
participant "Python Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Script API" as API
participant "Lua VM" as Lua
participant "Decision" as Decision
participant "Action" as Action
participant "Dofus Server" as Server

Client -> Proxy: Game Packet
Proxy -> Parser: Forward Packet
Parser -> Orchestrator: Parsed Data
Orchestrator -> API: Expose Data
API -> Lua: Script Execution
Lua -> Decision: Evaluate Logic
Decision -> Action: Generate Response
Action -> Orchestrator: Action Command
Orchestrator -> Proxy: Inject/Modify Packet
Proxy -> Server: Modified Packet
Server -> Proxy: Server Response
Proxy -> Parser: Response Packet
Parser -> Orchestrator: Parsed Response
Orchestrator -> API: Update State
API -> Lua: Notify Script
Lua -> Decision: Process Response
Decision -> Action: Next Action
Action -> Orchestrator: Continue Loop

@enduml